,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-07-27T03:45:51Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T09:37:18Z","closed_at":"2026-07-27T09:00:58Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121813","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121813","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121813.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121813.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"\r\nIt introduces a dedicated Virtual Keyboard disable button for the Android Editor under in the Touch Action Panel!\r\n\r\nWhat problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nWorking on small device screens like phones can become a hurdle when the Virtual Keyboard pops up after every accidental tap on an input field, especially within the script editor. A dedicated button to suppress the keyboard provides a much smoother workflow when text input isn't immediately needed.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a960cdbf-9876-4ff3-867b-26fefecb2b0e\r\n\r\nAfter: \r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3bcfc00f-2e74-492f-b224-e48c9c6ce8d1\r\n\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n​Note on Editor Updates: I recognize that the introduction of touch support for TextEdit and CodeEdit in 4.8 dev1 already solves a massive hurdle for the Script Editor environment on touch displays. However, this global suppression toggle remains useful for other edge cases and subjective user workflows!\r\n​Note on AI: AI tools were utilized to help locate the relevant C++ engine areas (like display_server_android.cpp) and generate boilerplate code snippets for this implementation.","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121813/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121813/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}